OL,3,AbA Scale of cyber-security flaw
OL,4,A'unprecedented' but no sign of
OL,5,Abreaches, says expert
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn the UK, a minister says 32
OL,8,Fgovernment services are unavailable and
OL,9,Ffour partially unavailable, as problems
OL,10,Fare fixed - the Canadian government
OL,11,Fsays some of its services are also down
OL,13,FThe chief executive of Microsoft, Satya
OL,14,FNadella, says he has "not seen anything
OL,15,Flike this in a long, long time"
